  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 4004.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the requirements in RSA 170-E:56, II relative to conducting background checks for youth skill camps (YSCs).\n\nSource. #12981, INTERIM, eff 1-24-20, EXPIRED: 7-22-20\n\nNew. #13073, eff 7-23-20; ss by #14256, eff 5-23-25, EXPIRES: 5-23-35",
